{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026PYARBfo4Sq1793022975.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>日本沖繩的嘉手納美軍基地，禁止中國車廠比亞迪的車輛進入。</p><p></p><p>日本共同社報道，使用嘉手納基地的美國空軍第18航空團，周一表示已經決定禁止比亞迪的車輛進入基地。韓國韓聯社早前引述駐日美軍官員，表示美方擔心電動車使用的攝影機以及感應器，能收集並洩露基地敏感資料。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.BYD-2300_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Xm7RAVoqhL1793022984.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>美國政府早前已將比亞迪列入協助中國軍方企業名單，中方強烈反對，批評美方泛化國家安全概念，無理打壓中國企業。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T15:21:14.834420+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T11:52:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T19:58:15.619998+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T15:18:21.167542+00:00","content_hash":"16483b3052c4312a29be47f106e9a9a4c98adcc7454b7fd541c23919ade6a83d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}